# Claude Code's git worktrees. Each is a full checkout of this repo on its own
# branch, so committing them would commit the repo into itself — and a plain
# `git add -A` at the root will try. Scoped to worktrees/ rather than all of
# .claude/, because settings and skills that live alongside them are shared
# project config and should be committed.
.claude/worktrees/
